WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.569
We hope you're
doing great tonight.

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:05.138
Now let's get to the news.

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:06.839
President Biden today signed

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:10.276
the Puppies Assisting
Wounded Servicemembers

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.412
for Veterans Therapy Act
into law.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:14.613
Democrats are calling it
a vital service,

00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:17.550
and Republicans
are calling it tyranny.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.719
President Biden
announced yesterday

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:22.889
that the U.S. will keep
its August 31st deadline

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.724
to withdraw from Afghanistan,

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.026
added Biden,
"Because that's been the plan

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:29.929
since the very beginning
of the week."

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.665
Two members of Congress
made an unauthorized trip

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.968
to Afghanistan yesterday and
stayed for less than 24 hours

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:38.070
before leaving on a flight
that was intended

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.206
to be used to evacuate people
from the country.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.507
In their defense,

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:46.379
that's just how Priceline booked
their trip to Cincinnati.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.981
White House press secretary
Jen Psaki yesterday

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:50.716
praised former President Trump

00:00:50.716 --> 00:00:53.386
for urging his supporters
at a rally over the weekend

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:54.887
to get the coronavirus vaccine

00:00:54.887 --> 00:00:57.023
and said
the Biden administration

00:00:57.023 --> 00:01:00.259
"will take anyone
who has a big platform."

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:04.264
Except right now the biggest
problem is the biggest platform.

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:05.898
President Biden
reportedly received

00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:08.100
a classified intelligence report
yesterday

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.804
that was inconclusive about
the origins of the coronavirus,

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:14.006
contradicting
your uncle's report

00:01:14.006 --> 00:01:17.944
that AOC slept with a bat.

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:21.414
According to a new study,
antibodies from llamas

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.816
may prevent infections
from coronavirus.

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:27.954
And, of course, now you can't
find any llamas at Costco.

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.892
The "New York Post" this week
published a negative review

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.995
of the restaurant at
the new Margaritaville Resort

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:37.330
in Times Square.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.899
You think Jimmy Buffett cares?

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.233
He's not even gonna see it.

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:43.903
He reads the leisure section,
and the rest of the paper

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:46.606
is just to shield his eyes
from the sun.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.841
He doesn't even know
that resort opened yet.

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:52.878
"It's 2021 already?
Wow, that was a good nap."

00:01:52.878 --> 00:01:56.048
A theme park in Japan recently
shut down a roller coaster

00:01:56.048 --> 00:01:59.452
capable of reaching speeds
up to 112 miles per hour

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.254
after four riders
reported injuries.

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:04.224
Apparently what happened
was the roller coaster

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:08.728
reaches speeds
up to 112 miles per hour.

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:11.764
Online platform OnlyFans
announced today

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:15.534
that it will cancel plans
to ban sexually explicit content

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:17.536
from its site
following an outcry from users,

00:02:17.536 --> 00:02:20.472
but after the outcry,
users pretty quickly relaxed,

00:02:20.472 --> 00:02:22.842
and then they just fell asleep.

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:25.644
And finally...

00:02:25.644 --> 00:02:27.513
Finally, Harvard Law School
this week

00:02:27.513 --> 00:02:29.415
unveiled their
new redesigned logo.

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:33.052
It's a mom telling her friends
her son goes there.

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:35.221
And that, you guys,
was the monologue.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:36.256
They kept the Latin.

